s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-24T17:10:39Z"},"body":"As a continuation of the new dock system, this PR changes main screen editors into docks.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/455dd81f-53a7-41e8-984c-3080a714ff0b\r\n\r\nAs a result:\r\n- Main screen is registered as an available dock slot and dock layout\r\n- Main screen editors are no longer tied to a specific plugin, they are just regular EditorDocks\r\n- The old main screen plugin workflow is deprecated. It's still supported, but compatibility might be broken in some edge cases\r\n- Main screen docks have their own editor setting for tab style\r\n- All main screens can float*\r\n  - *Except Game, which has a custom floating behavior with a very tightly integrated WindowWrapper that can't simply be removed\r\n- All main screens can be closed\r\n\r\n`_has_main_screen()` still exists in EditorPlugin and plugins that have a main screen are still \"separate\". However I'm not sure how much difference does it make. Like, ideally the method should return `true` if the plugin has a dock located in the main screen (so not floating or moved elsewhere), but from my testing it does not really matter.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14807","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113051/reactions","total_count":190,"+1":100,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":16,"confused":0,"heart":37,"rocket":11,"eyes":26},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113051/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}